post.description:
Login with email and password. Returns JWT tokens.

**Example response:**
```json
{
    "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
    "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
    "token_type": "bearer",
    "user": { "id": "...", "email": "jane@example.com", ... }
}
```
